% Each @dualentry produces two entries: fa:<key> for the Persian to English
% glossary and en:<key> for the English to Persian one. Cite them with \واژه.
%
% An existing glossary file written with \نوواژه can be converted with the
% convertgls2bib tool which comes with bib2gls. Note that a key may not contain
% a space, so a term of more than one word needs an explicit key, exactly as the
% optional argument of \نوواژه already allowed.

